          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "120"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.054,
            0.6,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.372,
            0.125,
            0.664,
            0.149
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验41 细胞计数"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.157,
            0.274,
            0.179
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.191,
            0.614,
            0.21
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "掌握细胞培养过程的细胞计数和存活率计算方法。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.221,
            0.274,
            0.243
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.255,
            0.912,
            0.337
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞培养是培养连续细胞系或者离体正常组织或肿瘤细胞的技术，而细胞计数不仅能够体现细胞培养的状态，同时也是细胞继代培养及判断实验处理对细胞培养的影响所必需的。细胞计数的结果可以用每毫升培养基（液体悬浮培养）或每平方厘米（固体单层培养）的细胞数来表示。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.345,
            0.447,
            0.541
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.131,
                0.345,
                0.447,
                0.541
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_6_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.169,
                0.553,
                0.417,
                0.569
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图8-1 血细胞计数器一个计数"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.472,
            0.34,
            0.914,
            0.592
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞计数的方法可以分为三大类:①运用光学显微镜和血细胞计数器对细胞进行直接计数，又称直接视觉方法；②运用光学显微镜和血细胞计数器对细胞核进行计数，又称间接视觉计数；③运用电子系统自动进行视觉计数。悬浮培养的或可转换进入悬浮液体的细胞的计数通常采用直接视觉方法，图8-1是血细胞计数器一个计数区的示意图。血细胞计数器是精密的玻璃仪器，具有两个可以计数的区室，每个计数区由9个亚区构成，每个亚区的面积为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1mm^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，同时血细胞计数器具有一个厚度一定的玻璃盖片，保证了计数区与盖片之间的距离为0.100mm。当盖片放置"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.572,
            0.393,
            0.588
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "区的示意图（Celis，2006）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.595,
            0.914,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "正确, 每个亚区之上的体积为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.1 \\mathrm{~mm}^{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 或 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\times 10^{-4} \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。统计两个计数区中的角亚区和中央亚区中的细胞数目为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "N"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 这时统计的体积为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。如果在准备的过程中, 缓冲液和染液对细胞的稀释倍数为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "D"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 那么样品的细胞密度 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "C = N \\times D \\times 10^{3} \\text{个/ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.661,
            0.915,
            0.723
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "运用血细胞计数器进行细胞活力的测定时常涉及染色阻止实验，它主要是根据活细胞能阻止特定的染料（如台盼蓝）穿过细胞膜而阻止被染色，而死细胞则会吸收染料而被染色的原理进行的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.733,
            0.44,
            0.755
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.767,
            0.84,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 仪器、用具: 显微镜、血细胞计数板、统计计数器、巴氏吸管、试管。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.789,
            0.433,
            0.807
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:培养的细胞悬液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.81,
            0.263,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.831,
            0.485,
            0.85
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）杜尔贝科磷酸缓冲液（DPBS）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.853,
            0.373,
            0.87
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）0.4%台盼蓝染液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.874,
            0.691,
            0.893
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）RPMI 1640 培养液、小牛血清、0.25%胰蛋白酶液等。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 7,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.385,
            0.053,
            0.622,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第八章 细胞和组织培养技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.83,
            0.055,
            0.863,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "121"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.096,
            0.288,
            0.12
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.129,
            0.313,
            0.147
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 细胞悬浮液的稀释"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.151,
            0.726,
            0.17
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 取 0.3ml 的 DPBS 加入体积不小于 1.0ml 的聚丙烯试管中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.172,
            0.895,
            0.211
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）用移液管吹打细胞悬浮液 2～5 次至均匀，然后取 0.1ml 的样品加入试管中，再吹打 2～5 次，使细胞液与 DPBS 混合均匀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.213,
            0.807,
            0.232
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 加入 0.1ml 0.4% 的台盼蓝染液，用移液管吹打 2~5 次混匀，备用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.233,
            0.436,
            0.251
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 血细胞计数器的使用和细胞计数"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.255,
            0.897,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）将血细胞计数器及其盖片从 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "70\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 乙醇槽中取出，晾干后正确装配。用巴氏吸管吸取足量已处理悬浮液，加入V形填补槽中，使液体充满计数器。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.297,
            0.898,
            0.356
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）将计数板放在显微镜载物台上，低倍镜下（10×10）分别对每个亚区中已染色细胞（死细胞）和未染色细胞（活细胞）进行计数。计数的亚区为每个计数区中的4个外角亚区和中央亚区（9个中的5个）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.359,
            0.58,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 将细胞液移出，清洗计数器，放回乙醇槽。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.379,
            0.294,
            0.397
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 细胞计数的计算"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.401,
            0.897,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）运用公式 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "C = N \\times D \\times 10^{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 计算样品中活细胞的密度，其中 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "N"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 表示统计得到的活细胞数目。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.442,
            0.896,
            0.483
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）计算活细胞在细胞中所占的比例， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "V = N / T \\times 100\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "V"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 表示活细胞的比例， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "N"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 表示活细胞的数目， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 表示所有细胞的数目。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.491,
            0.262,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.526,
            0.896,
            0.565
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）计数区的正确加样。计数区必须在没有溢流的情况下通过毛细作用进行加样，移液管和血细胞计数器都必须非常洁净。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.568,
            0.898,
            0.628
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）台盼蓝与血清蛋白的亲和力比与细胞蛋白的活性高，因此在运用台盼蓝作为阻碍染液时，细胞需要在 DPBS 或其他无血清的培养基中维持悬浮状态；同时在细胞计数之前需要将细胞液与其混匀并维持 5～10min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.631,
            0.898,
            0.67
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 计数时, 如果有细胞位于线上, 只计左边线和上边线上的细胞, 不计右边线和下边线上的细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.679,
            0.207,
            0.702
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.714,
            0.722,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "根据观察结果，计算每毫升细胞悬液中的细胞数和细胞存活率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.808,
            0.758,
            0.895,
            0.775
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(何炎明)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.314,
            0.812,
            0.695,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验 42 动物细胞原代培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.844,
            0.261,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.878,
            0.58,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 了解细胞原代培养的基本方法和操作过程。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
